## [loan / Loan Shark dialogue]
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.greeting.1=Step into my office. Mind the sharks.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.greeting.2=Short on chips? Happens to the best of us. Mostly to the rest of us.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.greeting.3=I believe in you. I also believe in interest.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.greeting.4=Everybody wins eventually. Until then — me.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.greeting.5=Friendly rates for friendly faces. Yours will do.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.given.1=Pleasure doing business. Don't make me miss you.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.given.2=Spend it wisely. Or at least quickly.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.given.3=That's the easy part. The hard part is giving it back.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.given.4=Red or black — just come back.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.repaid.1=Paid in full. A rare and beautiful thing.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.repaid.2=You're a person of your word. I'll remember that.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.repaid.3=And here I was, sharpening my pencil.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.repaid.4=Come back anytime. I mean it. Financially.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.overdue.1=Well, well. Look who remembered where I live.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.overdue.2=You're late. I don't like late. My associates like it even less.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.overdue.3=We were on "you" terms. Now we're on "you owe" terms.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.overdue.4=Every day you're late, the number gets bigger. Math is cruel.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.overdue.5=Pay up and we forget this ever happened. Mostly.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.refuse_vip.1=That kind of money is for people with a better card than yours.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.refuse_vip.2=Play a bit more first. I like to know my clients.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.refuse_vip.3=Ambitious. I like it. The answer's still no.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.piglin_greeting.1=Gold? Chips? I lend both. Returns are… mandatory.
dialog.burmaldaholic.loan.piglin_greeting.2=Snort. You look like someone who needs a loan.
## [loan / Debt Collector dialogue]
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.demand.1=Evening. We're from the bank. You know why we're here.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.demand.2=%1. That's the number. Say it with us.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.demand.3=Nice house. Would be a shame if we had to wait inside it.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.demand.4=The boss says hi. The boss also says pay.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.demand.5=We can do this the easy way, or the other way. We brought equipment for both.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.hostile.1=Wrong answer.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.hostile.2=Okay. The other way it is.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.hostile.3=Boys, he's not paying.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.hostile.4=Running only raises the late fee.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.hostile.5=Nothing personal. It's accounting.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.paid.1=Pleasure doing business. We were never here.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.paid.2=See? Nobody got hurt. Well, your wallet.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.paid.3=Account closed. Have a nice day.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.paid.4=Boss will be pleased. Let's go, boys.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.partial.1=Half now, half later. We'll be back tomorrow.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.partial.2=It's a start. We know where you live.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.partial.3=Good faith payment accepted. Don't make it the last one.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.repossess.1=We'll take that. And that. Thanks for your cooperation.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.repossess.2=Consider it a down payment.
dialog.burmaldaholic.collector.repossess.3=Should've paid. Would've been cheaper.
dialog.burmaldaholic.accountant.audit.1=Let's go over your expenses.
dialog.burmaldaholic.accountant.audit.2=According to my records, you're in trouble.
dialog.burmaldaholic.accountant.audit.3=Debit: you. Credit: also you.
dialog.burmaldaholic.enforcer.line.1=Hrrm. Pay.
dialog.burmaldaholic.enforcer.line.2=I don't do math. I do follow-ups.
dialog.burmaldaholic.enforcer.line.3=Boss sent me. That's bad news for you.
